## Results: tracked (benchmark tables, CSVs, charts), except large files.
# Git cannot ignore by size, so two guards keep files over ~5 MB out:
#   1. results/.gitignore lists them; regenerate it with
#      scripts/ignore-large-results.sh after a run.
#   2. the pre-commit hook (scripts/hooks/pre-commit) refuses to commit any
#      staged file under results/ bigger than 5 MB.
# Raw binary/compressed outputs are never wanted in git, whatever their size:
results/**/*.bin
results/**/*.gz
results/**/*.itch
